id: majin-malice
name: Majin Malice
order: 9
category: mind
importance: secondary
description: >
  Your regenerative powers allow you to force your body past the limits most species would be able to survive.
text: >
  Majin Malice (Mind): Your regenerative powers allow you to force your body past the limits most species would be able to survive.
  (1)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you would use a Healing Surge, you may forgo gaining Life Points to instead regain an equal amount of Ki Points and Capacity instead. This can allow your Capacity to exceed your Max Capacity.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you would use an Ultimate Signature Technique, you may apply up to 5 ranks of Backlash to that Signature Technique. For each rank of Backlash added, increase the Wound Roll of that Signature Technique by 2(T).
  (3)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round, 3/Encounter]: You may spend 5(bT) Life Points to use the Basic Attack Maneuver, Signature Technique Maneuver, or Energy Charge Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# (1) A Healing Surge about to be used - asked in its window: what it would give in Life Points given as Ki Points and
# Capacity instead, the Capacity past its Max for the Round (chat.mjs takeSurge).
[triggered/healing-surge, 1/round, effect 1]
surge.asKi = true;

# (2) An Ultimate Signature Technique declared: Backlash ranks to add, asked with its declaration - 2(T) Wound each, and
# their Life Points after it as Backlash takes them; at most 5 between them and its own. Once an Encounter.
[passive]
allow malice.backlash;

# (3) The Power Up used - asked in its window: 5(bT) Life Points for the Basic Attack, a Signature Technique or the Energy
# Charge, out of sequence (chat.mjs answerPower).
[triggered/power, 1/round, 3/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 3]
malice.outOfSequence = true;
